<!--
  Hardened-runtime entitlements for Crow Term. Intentionally empty.
  Crow Term has no JIT, loads no third-party or unsigned dylibs/plugins, and
  never sets DYLD_* for itself. Shells and tools are separate executables run
  through a PTY (fork/exec), each governed by its own code signature, so no
  com.apple.security.cs.* exception is needed. Add a key only with evidence
  (a reproduced failure), never preemptively. See docs/release.md.
-->
